  "239": {
    "inputs": {
      "PromptState": "{\"text\":\"<Subject 1> is the young woman from the reference image, preserving her long wavy black hair, warm brown eyes, small bindi, gold hoop earrings, softly defined brows, natural warm complexion, and calm expressive face. She wears a simple white top.\\n\\n<Subject 2> is the warm sunlit garden setting from the reference image background, preserving the soft-focus greenery, blush-pink flowering shrubs, pale golden stone architecture, and gentle daytime light.\\n\\nsummary:\\n\\n[reference generation] A 5-second landscape talking clip. <Subject 1> faces the camera in a soft-focus garden and delivers a single spoken line to the lens, gesturing lightly as if directing the viewer's attention to something nearby, lip-synced to the provided audio.\\n\\nretention_analysis:\\n\\n<Subject 1> (appears in [Shot 1]): fully_preserved — her face, hair, bindi, hoop earrings, and calm warmth remain clearly recognizable throughout.\\n<Subject 2> (appears in [Shot 1]): fully_preserved — the blurred garden greenery, pink blooms, and warm stone backdrop stay soft behind her.\\n\\ndetailed_description:\\n\\n[Shot 1] A flattering medium close-up frames <Subject 1> centered against the soft-focus sunlit garden, her hair loose over one shoulder with a light breeze lifting a few strands. She looks directly into the lens, then her expression shifts to warm, engaged interest as she gently turns her head and glances slightly off to one side, as though noticing something worth pointing out. Her mouth begins closed and still, then she speaks naturally and clearly, her lips, jaw, and micro-expressions synced precisely to the audio: <d>[English] Look here, this small child is taking water for workers.</d> On \\\"look here,\\\" she gives a small, natural tilt of the head and a subtle guiding glance to draw the viewer's eye; through the rest of the line her brows lift softly with warmth and mild wonder, eyes staying bright and connected. Small natural blinks and gentle head movement keep it lifelike. The background stays gently blurred so attention holds on her face and expression. The camera is locked and steady with a barely perceptible slow push-in across the five seconds. The clip ends as she finishes the line and returns her gaze fully to the lens, settling into a soft, warm closed-mouth smile.\\n\\noverall_soundscape:\\n\\nQuiet outdoor garden ambience — faint birdsong, a soft breeze through leaves — kept low so the spoken line stays clear and forward.\\n\\nnon_diegetic_music:\\n\\nOptional light underscore — a single sustained warm pad or a few soft piano notes, very quiet, supporting the mood without competing with the voice. Omit entirely if the line should stand alone.\",\"order\":\"mine\",\"sep\":\", \"}"
    },
    "class_type": "PixaromaPrompt",
    "_meta": {
      "title": "4. The Prompt"
    }
  },
